# Front End Design & Styling

styling like this and we'll use this as inspiration. All pages must be styled including any pages added via ASP.NET MVC.

https://tailwindcss.com/plus/templates

The front end of the application needs to be styled and designed using TailwindCSS and use a modern, clean UI / UX. Below are a list of examples from TailwindCSS plus with brief descriptions. Use these examples as inspiration for the app styling:

**Important: All HTML & CSS (+JS) must be done mobile first, as well as any UI / UX. It most look great and function seamlessly between mobile and desktop.**

All examples below are shown using Vue.JS. **BUT YOU MUST CONVERT TO USE AplineJS.**

